        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/29425 . I'm neutral on this now only because analyzing diffs can catch N/A changes from files not considered N/A. (Without diff analysis, I'll mark them all N/A now unlike last year. Same with sound and other \"non-core\" features.) Even if `version[0-9]+.txt` are marked N/A, modifying `xfuncname` is required for correctly analyzing N/A `runtime/` files.\r\n\r\nBased on table-of-contents, less than half is _possibly_ applicable for `news.txt`  (ie. features, incompatible, improvements). `new-vim-script-9` should be ignored to skip vim9script.\r\n\r\nThe decision is for whoever maintains `news.txt` and if they bother inspect these version files independent of  Vim's patches.\r\n\r\n```\r\nNEW FEATURES                                    |new-9|\r\n   Vim script enhancements                      |new-vim-script-9|\r\n   Command line completion in a popup menu      |new-popup-compl|\r\n   Updated colorschemes                         |new-colorschemes-9|\r\n   Various new items                            |new-items-9|\r\n\r\nINCOMPATIBLE CHANGES                            |incompatible-9|\r\n\r\nIMPROVEMENTS                                    |improvements-9|\r\n\r\nCOMPILE TIME CHANGES                            |compile-changes-9|\r\n\r\nPATCHES                                         |patches-9|\r\n\r\nVERSION 9.1                                     |version-9.1|\r\n   Changed                                      |changed-9.1|\r\n   Added                                        |added-9.1|\r\n   Patches                                      |patches-9.1|\r\n\r\nVERSION 9.2                                     |version-9.2|\r\n   Changed                                      |changed-9.2|\r\n   Added                                        |added-9.2|\r\n   Patches                                      |patches-9.2|\r\n\r\nVERSION 9.3                                     |version-9.3|\r\n   Changed                                      |changed-9.3|\r\n   Added                                        |added-9.3|\r\n   Patches                                      |patches-9.3|\r\n```",
            "created_at": "2026-07-25T01:53:33Z",
